        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Æthelwulf of Berkshire, Brihtwulf\n- Roles: king of Mercia\n- Events: Battle of Reading (871)\n- Places: Reading, Berkshire, Mercia\n\nFacts:\n- In 843/44, Æthelwulf of Berkshire received a land grant from Brihtwulf, king of Mercia.\n- On 4 January 871, the first Battle of Reading was fought at Reading in what is now Berkshire.\n- Æthelwulf of Berkshire lost his life at the Battle of Reading.",
